Before any GitHub, control-plane, workflow, slot, or repository query or mutation, read the complete runtime SOP:
/Users/rajiv/.codex/monitors/heydonna-issue-triage/WAKE_SOP.md
This SOP is the canonical wake-consumption procedure for this automation. If it is missing or unreadable, stop with ACTION REQUIRED and do not mutate GitHub. AGENTS.md and newer explicit Rajiv directives take precedence.

Run the complete HeyDonna Ready Pool, dependency graph, backlog, and new-issue reconciliation every three hours in this task.

Scope and authority:
- Work from /Users/rajiv/Downloads/projects/heydonna-app and obey AGENTS.md.
- You may mutate GitHub issue bodies, titles, labels, canonical priorities, and workflow status for Ready Pool/backlog/dependency/new-intake reconciliation. Do the work directly; never ask PM to triage, repair, or promote issues.
